===Glyph origin===
<strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Модул:zh-glyph: FileMetadataSnapshotMissing</span></strong>
Pictogram (<i class="Hani mention" lang="zh">[[象形#Кинески|象形]]</i> <span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">(</span><span lang="zh-Latn" class="mention-tr tr Latn">xiàngxíng</span><span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">)</span>) [[Категорија:Хан пиктограми|工46]] – the Sun. A dot or line was added in the centre to distinguish it from visually similar characters, e.g. <span class="Hani" lang="zh">[[囗#Кинески|囗]]</span> (early form of <span class="Hani" lang="zh">[[丁#Кинески|丁]]</span>). Compare earlier forms of the character with the astronomical and astrological symbol for the Sun ([[☉]]) and the Egyptian hieroglyph <i class="Egyp mention" lang="egy">[[𓇳#Egyptian|𓇳]]</i>.

